## Third-party / derived files

**`m711/dados.py` is GPLv3**, not MIT. It is generated by `m711/gerar_dados.py`
from the byte tables in `port/mouse_m908` (the `dokutan/mouse_m908` driver,
GPL-3.0-or-later, by George Florea Bănuș and contributors). Those tables are a
direct derivation of the original author's reverse engineering of the vendor
protocol, and the copyleft propagates to the derived data. See the header of
`m711/dados.py`.

`port/mouse_m908` itself is not part of this project — it is a git submodule
pointing at <https://github.com/dokutan/mouse_m908>, GPL-3.0-or-later.

The Redragon vendor software (`RDCfg.exe`) is proprietary and is **not**
redistributed here.
